From ffd86ed87494f31fb866da8b4d817c1cbf1a4b9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:30:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] Add the auto section of .pp files: model, load/save and
 validation

A project gains one top-level key, auto, holding the whole Autonomous as
cards (actions, firstOf waits and decisions, path cards). The loader
normalizes it without throwing and reports what it repaired; save writes
it in a fixed key order and omits it when a project has no Auto. Undo,
session recovery, the file manager and mirroring carry it along.

Validation flags unregistered names, waits without a time row, missing
or nested paths, double park cards and path discontinuities. A small
Vite-based test runner (npm test) covers round trip and validation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
